# All nine M1 routes. Supply private variables locally; do not commit credentials/responses.
# Positive MySQL/HTTP demonstration with isolated C/D + SMS test doubles:
# TASK05_DB_TEST=true, Maven -Dtest=M1MySqlIntegrationTest -DargLine=-Xmx768m test
# See task05 handoff for the exclusive build lock and explicit Maven settings.
# The suite starts/stops 127.0.0.1:18085 and tests the default-deny context on 18086.
# A normally launched application refuses necessary C/D/SMS operations until real adapters exist.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18085/api/v1

### AU01: USERNAME or PHONE, password only; unknown/uninitialized/paused/terminated/locked => 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"loginType":"USERNAME","identifier":"{{username}}","password":"{{password}}"}

### AU05: proof is delivered only through the configured channel; never in this response
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"{{phone}}","purpose":"SET_PASSWORD"}

### AU07: repeat => 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS; password policy/history => 422 BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password/initialize
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"{{phone}}","code":"{{setPasswordCode}}","newPassword":"{{newPassword}}"}

### AU08: first request AU05 with purpose RESET_PASSWORD; password policy/history => 422, proof remains unconsumed
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"{{phone}}","code":"{{resetPasswordCode}}","newPassword":"{{newPassword}}"}

### AU04: repeat safely; only this jti is revoked
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### US01: username/employee-number keyword, or complete mobile exact match
# Name substring search remains unresolved; original design keyword=张 example is retained there.
# Optional status/source: 1/2/3; page 1..1000000, pageSize 1..500. All filters intersect current scope.
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?keyword={{keyword}}&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### US01: combine department, account state and origin with keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?keyword={{keyword}}&deptId={{deptId}}&status=2&source=1&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### US01: upper page boundary; empty items can still have a nonzero filtered total
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?status=3&source=1&page=1000000&pageSize=500
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### US01: 400 INVALID_ARGUMENT (also status=4, source=HR, pageSize=501)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1000001
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### US02
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### US03: no initial password, SG number or automatic role; unique conflict => 409 DUPLICATE_RESOURCE
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/temporary
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"realName":"{{realName}}","phone":"{{phone}}","deptId":"{{deptId}}","reason":"temporary support"}

### US04: 2 pauses, 1 resumes; old sessions stay invalid; HR/terminated target => 422, absent/outside => 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":2,"reason":"temporary account paused"}
